1
00:00:00,640 --> 00:00:03,890
(Wyatt:)Now, get your sorry,
lying ass out of my face

2
00:00:03,890 --> 00:00:06,120
(Wyatt:)and make sure I
never see it again!

3
00:00:06,130 --> 00:00:08,090
(Leonard:)Oh, the reverse psychology
thing.

4
00:00:08,090 --> 00:00:09,560
(Leonard:)I see. That's very clever.

5
00:00:09,560 --> 00:00:11,800
(Wyatt:)Don't yap. Just get out.

6
00:00:12,620 --> 00:00:14,430
(Leonard:)I'll friend you on Facebook.

7
00:00:21,040 --> 00:00:22,670
(Sheldon:)Oh, there you are.

8
00:00:22,680 --> 00:00:25,280
(Sheldon:)Just so you know,
I was up all night,

9
00:00:25,280 --> 00:00:27,180
(Sheldon:)but I have finally completed

10
00:00:27,180 --> 00:00:31,020
(Sheldon:)the Penny-specific section
of the new roommate agreement.

11
00:00:31,020 --> 00:00:32,680
(Leonard:)Yeah, well, not necessary.

12
00:00:32,690 --> 00:00:34,450
(Leonard:)We broke up again.

13
00:00:46,670 --> 00:00:49,830
(Sheldon:)Do you even think
about other people, Leonard?

14
00:00:51,170 --> 00:01:00,020
(Sheldon:)Do you?

